my  name is michael walker i'm a b-boy i'm a  break dancer  but i can do also some other dances but  my  main focus is uh is breaking  [Music]  i start a breaking in 1984 as  as a small kids in the hallways on the  streets  and then after after that i i started  practicing practicing with my friends my  next-door neighbors and then in  87 i stopped dancing i did some  martial arts some aikido some kung fu  and then in 97 i started breaking again  i was dancing in a crew called all-star  breakers  freezone optimal forma  even a bit optimal form i went to the  olympics in greece athens to do a show  and in 2001 i've worked with  uh john cd from  england from london on a small piece  and it was the first time actually i  was we were taking hip-hop breaking  into the theaters and that was my first  time  uh i was not breaking on the streets  but breaking in theaters in a theater  show  i make a piece with two good friends of  mine  mine dennis delano and lloyd mourinho  the piece called the offslog  in english i think it's called the exit  and it's based on all of the choices  people are making during life some  people from our  neighborhoods go to fight for  isis and come back to the neighborhood  so it's all old neighborhoods the piece  is  about why why did they  take that exit why  do they choose to take the taxes to go  fight with isis  and not just staying in  in the netherlands and do something  else because me  and the friends of mine we don't take  the taxi  we just stay where we are  working and stuff and also it's about  choices  [Music]  for me as a dancer with a disability  certain things i cannot do with my legs  but  it doesn't matter i will i will always  find  something that i can do  you

